 class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pm-mega\" class=\"rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-ink\">Shop All Boards</button></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-white-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/white-boards\">White Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-chalk-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/chalk-boards\">Chalk Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-notice-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/notice-boards\">Notice Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-collections-ceramic-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/collections/ceramic-boards\">Ceramic Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-display-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/display-boards\">Display Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-board-stands\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/board-stands\">Board Stands</a></div></div></div></nav></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Eco ADC Notice Board (Single Door)\",\"description\":\"The Eco ADC Notice Board is an acrylic door covered notice board with a single door. Lightweight aluminium framing keeps it economical and practical, while the transparent acrylic cover protects notices from dust and handling.\\n\\nA single-door locking system keeps the display safe and controlled, with smooth door operation and clear visibility of notices. The clean, simple finish suits regular indoor applications.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"url\":\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev/product/eco-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-ACR-1X1FT0\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Plusmark\"},\"category\":\"Acrylic Door Cover Notice Boards\",\"image\":[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/drt0rpkn2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1200,c_scale/plusmark/products/eco-adc-notice-board-single-door\"],\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"lowPrice\":580,\"highPrice\":4610,\"offerCount\":9,\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Acrylic Door Cover Notice Boards\",\"item\":\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev/shop/acrylic-door-cover-notice-boards\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Eco ADC Notice Board (Single Door)\",\"item\":\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev/product/eco-adc-notice-board-single-door\"}]}</scr