rk quotation.<!-- --> <!-- -->Sizes outside the published range are made to order.<!-- --> Eco Regular series.</p></div></div><aside id=\"buy-box\" class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-4 shadow-card sm:gap-5 sm:p-6 md:col-start-2 md:row-start-2 xl:col-start-3 xl:row-start-1 xl:sticky xl:top-52 xl:self-start\" aria-label=\"Buy this board\"><div><p class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">From</span><span class=\"tabular inline-flex items-baseline font-display font-bold leading-none text-ink text-[2rem]\"><span class=\"text-body-sm\">₹</span><span>580</span><sup class=\"text-[0.6em] font-semibold text-muted max-sm:hidden\">.<!-- -->00</sup></span><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">+ GST</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-subtle/70 p-3 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed sm:p-4 sm:text-body-sm\"><p class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Pan-India dispatch</span> from the Ahmedabad works. Freight and the delivery date are confirmed by the order desk for your PIN code.<!-- --> <a class=\"font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary\" href=\"/policies/shipping\">Shipping details</a></span></p><p class=\"mt-2 pl-[1.625rem] text-muted\">Free pickup from the Ahmedabad works.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-c