ink-soft\">Acrylic door covered notice board with single door design</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Framing</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Lightweight aluminium framing for economical and practical use</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Cover</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Transparent acrylic door cover to protect notices from dust and handling</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Locking</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Single-door locking system for safe and controlled notice display</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Performance</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Smooth door operation with clear visibility of displayed notices</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"border-r border-line bg-subtle/40 px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Finish</th><td class=\"px-4 py-3 align-top text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Clean and simple finish suitable for regular indoor applications</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-line\"><th scope=\"colgroup\" colSpan=\"2\" class=\"bg-subtle/80 px-4 py-2 text-left text-[0.75rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted\">General</th></tr><tr class