></div></details><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-care\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-care-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-care\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-care-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 lg:leading-[1.15]\">Care &amp; Delivery</h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"pt-4 lg:pt-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-droplets size-[1.125rem]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z\"></path><path d=\"M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold text-ink\">Care and maintenance</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Wipe the writing surface with a dry eraser or duster after use, then a soft cloth if any ghosting remains.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Use a slightly damp cloth on chalk surfaces and let the board dry before writing again.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Avoid solvent-based or abrasive cleaners, and do not leave marker ink on the surface overnight.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Do not use a writing board as a pin surface.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck size-[1.125rem]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold text-ink\">Delivery and installation</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Boards are made to order after the size, surface and price are confirmed.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Pan-India dispatch from the Plusmark works in Ahmedabad.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Pickup from the Narolgam works carries no transport charge.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Freight and the delivery estimate for your pincode are confirmed when the invoice is raised.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-line bg-subtle/50 px-4 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Not sure about the size or finish? The Plusmark order desk confirms the exact specification and price before the board goes into production.</p></div></div></details><section id=\"customer-reviews\" aria-label=\"Customer reviews for Eco ADC Notice Board (Single Door)\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line pt-8 lg:scroll-mt-56 lg:pt-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,19rem)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-[1.375rem] font-extrabold leading-7 te