 Door) is a notice board with a single-door acrylic cover. Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing provides strength, stability and long-term durability. The transparent acrylic door cover protects displayed notices from dust, moisture and handling, with a secure single-door locking system, smooth door operation and clear visibility of notices.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Surface — High gloss melamine writing surface\\\",\\\"Frame — Deluxe anodized aluminium frame\\\",\\\"Corners — Electroplated chrome corners\\\",\\\"Non-magnetic face\\\",\\\"Sizes made — 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"Custom sizes made to order\\\",\\\"Pan-India dispatch from Ahmedabad\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door) - Deluxe Standard ADC Notice Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":2000,\\\"height\\\":1600,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door--3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-ACR-3X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"3 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"heightCm\\\":91},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2580,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door--4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-DS-ACR-4X4FT0\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4-x-4-ft\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"4 x 4 ft\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":122,\\\"he